namefix-cpp
------------------------------------------
Fix bad filenames - tries to rename files so all characters are ASCII, replaces
spaces with an underscore and periods with a hypen, replaces all other
non-ASCII characters with a question mark and keeps extension untouched.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libicu76-76.1-2
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libicu-devel-76.1-2
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/sukulent/namefix-cpp

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/sukulent/namefix-cpp/archive/refs/tags/v1.3.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack namefix-cpp-1.3.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./namefix-cpp-1.3.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/namefix-cpp-1.3.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/namefix-cpp-1.3.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(namefix-cpp)
  /usr/bin/namefix.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/namefix-cpp.README
  /usr/share/doc/namefix-cpp/LICENSE.md
  /usr/share/doc/namefix-cpp/README.md
  /usr/share/man/man1/namefix.1.gz

